  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multinational - Agripitch 2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Multinational - Agripitch 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(i) Nurture a culture of innovation and technology-led innovations in agribusiness through capacity development, (ii) Facilitate access to finance for youth by convening relevant investors focused on start-ups and growing SMEs (iii) Enhance the investment readiness of agriprenuers through an intensive bootcamp training and ensure they are pitch-ready for investors, (iv) promote best practices ideas of agriprenuers on climate smart businesses.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engaging the youth in the agribusiness sector by providing them with employment and economic opportunities while addressing the important food and nutrition security challenges in Africa. Agripitch 2019 is a competition that promotes innovation and entreprenuership in agriculture among the youth in Africa to create jobs and improve livelihoods.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preselected agriprenuers</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
